id=custom_usb_g2_setup
name=USB Gadget g2 Setup (NetHunter)
version=v2.1
versionCode=3
author=NetHunter AI Operator
description=Prepares the configfs USB gadget g2 (HID keyboard + RNDIS + mass_storage) in /config/usb_gadget at boot (post-fs-data), without touching the active system gadget g1. g2 is never bound to a UDC by this module — activation/deactivation is done by usbtool under real root (guest: sudo / su_daemon re-entry; configfs is bind-mounted into the guest). Includes usbtool CLI (switch-usb-gadget) in /system/bin.
minMagisk=20400
